{"id":9,"course_no":"009","title":"python 数据分析与可视化","summary":"本课程假定你没有任何数据处理经验，从零开始学习如何使用Python进行数据分析和可视化。停止使用Excel，利用Python的力量。\r\n\r\n数据分析是21世纪热门的职业之一。作为一名分析师，你的目标是剥开数据层，以回答感兴趣的问题；这就是分析学的力量。它允许你利用原始数据，创造有意义的、可执行的见解。\r\n\r\n在本课程中，你将学习如何使用Python、NumPy、SciPy、Pandas和Seaborn来进行数据分析和可视化。你将探索任何数据分析项目的四个关键步骤：读取数据、描述数据、清理数据和可视化数据。在每个步骤中，你将使用数据分析师每天使用的常见和流行的工具。\r\n\r\n在课程结束时，详细你将自信地从数据中提取知识和答案。","brief_summary":"","details":"","cover_img":"/content/assets/ecf1cd04508e8dd1f258.jpeg","mini_cover_img":null,"mobile_cover_img":"/content/assets/ecf1cd04508e8dd1f258.jpeg","intro_video_url":null,"target_audience":"beginner","work_mode":"","is_mini":false,"is_educative":true,"is_active":true,"course_type":"educative","read_hour":"8","rank":13,"language":"python","mall_cover_img":null,"mall_cover_v2_img":"/content/assets/0d69e3c72c8b10de16ee.png","learning_points":"test","share_your_gets":"test","share_sub_title":"python 数据分析与可视化","skills":[],"cates":[4],"toc":{"categories":[{"id":42,"seq_no":0,"title":"什么是数据分析","type":"COLLECTION_CATEGORY","icon_url":null,"pages":[{"id":370,"title":"介绍","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":true,"coaches":[],"number":"1.1","status":"undo"},{"id":371,"title":"Python与数据分析","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":false,"coaches":[],"number":"2.1","status":"undo"}],"coaches":[],"learn_info":{"page_num":2,"learn_page_num":0,"coach_num":0,"learn_coach_num":0}},{"id":43,"seq_no":1,"title":"Python中的数据分析","type":"COLLECTION_CATEGORY","icon_url":null,"pages":[{"id":372,"title":"开始","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":true,"coaches":[],"number":"3.1","status":"undo"},{"id":373,"title":"数据结构","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":false,"coaches":[],"number":"4.1","status":"undo"},{"id":374,"title":"控制流和内置函数","sub_title":"","type":"collection_le